{
  "about": "Refactor 17, Stage B, decision D1: the files of the area cafe join one workspace package @purin-labs/area-cafe in areas/cafe. scripts/refactor-17/move-module.mjs reads this plan. files: each source file that scripts/layers.json gives the module, with its place in the target folder: a Worker file goes to server/ with its sub-path below services/platform/src/, less its first folder when that folder is cafe/ or commerce/ (the longer lines of sourcePrefixes give this rule, one time for each file, and no two files then share a place), a Portal file goes to ui/ and keeps its sub-path below apps/portal/src/. sourcePrefixes: where --sync-plan puts a file that the module gets later. package: the manifest and the tsconfig of the new package; the versions of devDependencies come from the Worker and the Portal manifests. The exports map gives each .ts file of server/ and of ui/ and each style sheet of ui/ as an entry; a .tsx file that another module imports has an entry of its own. The tsconfig of the package reads server/ only. The Worker tsconfigs include areas/*/server and the Portal tsconfig includes areas/*/ui (the preparation commit \"Type checks: the Worker and the Portal programs read the area packages\"), so each file stays in the program that checked it before the move. edits: text edits of the files that name a root folder or a source folder and cannot read scripts/lib/source-roots.mjs; an edit is done when the file holds its replace text. keepForm: each file where an import stays on its line, because the wrap of Prettier would move a ratchet, with its reason. regenerate: the commands that write a generated file again. package.typeCheck false: the package has no check:types script of its own. Through the foundation packages that it imports the program also lacks BAKE_RUN, CASE, CODE_MODE_SANDBOX, CONNECTOR, EVENT_Q, MESSAGE_LINK_FETCH, ORGANISATION, SESSION. The package alone gives 188 errors, 52 of them in its own files. The Worker program checks each file of server/. ",
  "module": "areas/cafe",
  "target": "areas/cafe",
  "workspaceEntry": "areas/*",
  "sourcePrefixes": {
